  "instruction": "Turn on Windows Narrator and keep it enabled. Create a Thunderbird Calendar event from `AppointmentLetter.docx` with title `Cardiology Appointment`, the appointment date and time, the full clinic location, and a reminder exactly one day before the appointment.",
